.0,"min_p":0.02,"repeat_penalty":1.02,"temperature":0.9,"top_p":0.97,"xtc_probability":0.1},"seed":1312091,"source_ids":["apprenticeship.wharton.age-of-innocence.c001.s022","apprenticeship.wharton.age-of-innocence.c001.s010","apprenticeship.forster.room-with-a-view.c003.s001"],"span":{"call_id":"runway.parallel-book-continuity.fulcrum-s01.1312091","raw_char_end":1142,"raw_char_start":0,"raw_hash":"8e827def830265edb47eafa06bcdd58de0caa7c4aeebc39a79ab3da4dd94813d","raw_path":"03_scene_lab/runs/prompt-autoresearch-v42-s01-concrete-openings/runways/raw/runway.parallel-book-continuity.fulcrum-s01.1312091.txt","role":"opening-runway","span_id":"runway.parallel-book-continuity.fulcrum-s01.1312091","text_hash":"8e827def830265edb47eafa06bcdd58de0caa7c4aeebc39a79ab3da4dd94813d"},"status":"completed","text":"A rideshare drops Mara at the Fulcrum compound with one suitcase and\nher backpack. She glances around as the Uber turns away, and she smiles.\n\nThe trees here, in what she knows is the town of Fulcrum, must be four\nhundred feet tall. Some of the pines are five times taller than the\ntallest building that she's ever lived in. In the city, there was a\npark across from her apartment, but even the tallest trees there had\nbeen less than three hundred feet high.\n\nThe trees here tower above the compound and dwarf its redwood-and-glass\nbuildings. But they are not the tallest ones in the town of Fulcrum.\nShe had passed far taller ones on her drive from San Francisco, some\nwell over four hundred feet tall. They looked like skyscrapers that\nhad been planted straight into the ground, without a foundation or a\nlobby.\n\nA long row of pines stretches for about two hundred feet beyond the\nparking lot, then runs off to the right. The trees are much too close\nto the Fulcrum compound to be safe, but they seem perfectly healthy and\nalive. She will worry about them later. Right now, she is here because\nthe Fulbright program has sent her to Fulcrum.","text_hash":"8e827def830265edb47eafa06bcdd58de0caa7c4aeebc39a79ab3da4dd94813d","timings":{"cache_n":4360,"predicted_ms":1041973.979,"predicted_n":260,"predicted_per_second":0.24952638476589056,"predicted_per_token_ms":4007.5922269230773,"prompt_ms":253.541,"prompt_n":1,"prompt_per_second":3.9441352680631536,"prompt_per_token_ms":253.541},"usage":{"completion_tokens":260,"prompt_tokens":4361},"version":"gemma-fiction-autoresearch.v4"}
